    "id": "shipwithai/shipwithai-plugins/idempotent-endpoint",
    "name": "idempotent-endpoint",
    "description": "Scaffold idempotency-key handling for unsafe POSTs — read an Idempotency-Key header, replay the stored response on a retry instead of re-processing, otherwise process once and store the response keyed by (key, request fingerprint). Ships a servlet filter plus a storage SPI the project implements with Redis or a DB. Trigger phrases: \"idempotency key\", \"idempotent endpoint\", \"make POST idempotent\", \"safe retries\", \"exactly-once POST\", \"dedupe requests\".\n",
